  <h2>What today is about</h2>
  <p class="sub">Your first class. No content yet, no marks, nothing to submit.</p>
  <p>Today is for four things: meeting each other, walking through how this course actually runs, getting the practical set-up out of the way, and one conversation about the place we all live. The science starts next class with Block 1.</p>
  <p>Everything we mention today lives permanently on this site, so you do not need to take notes to keep up. If you miss today, read <a href="/foundations/how-this-class-works/">How This Class Works</a> and you will have the substance of it.</p>
</section>

